        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"942100\">@Alfredo Moreira-Rosa</span> I moved discussion about this away from the Project announcement channel that we try to keep very low traffic so that people don’t miss cool new projects in the middle of discussions of existing projects.</p>",
